{{Quote|"Sorry about that. We thought you were Bigfoot!"<br>"Yeah, I get that a lot. Well, Shocksquatch does."|[[Zak Saturday|Zak]] and [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]].<ref name="TGIS">''[[T.G.I.S.]]''</ref>}}
'''Shocksquatch''' is the [[Omnitrix]]'s DNA sample of a [[Gimlinopithecus]] from the planet [[Pattersonea]].{{Refn|[[:File:Scan 10.png]]|group = OV Brief|name = link}}

==Appearance==
In ''[[Ben 10-Generator Rex: Heroes United|Heroes United]]'', Shocksquatch was portrayed as a thick, muscular yeti-like alien. His body was covered in white, gray, and blue fur, and he had a reddish-pink face adorned with pointed eyebrows. The alien's green eyes had black pupils, and he had metallic gray circular bolts on the back of his hands and lower jaw. Moreover, he wore the [[Ultimatrix (Original)|Ultimatrix]] symbol on his chest.

In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', Shocksquatch's appearance changed. He now appears slimmer and had yellow and black fur. His fingers and toes were gray, and he has four fingers instead of five. Also, he has two bolts on the side of his wrists instead of the back of his hands. Additionally, Shocksquatch has green eyes with black pupils and yellow lightning bolt-shaped horns. He wears a green and white belt, which has the [[Omnitrix (Omniverse)|Omnitrix]] symbol on it.

