==Etymology==
Shocksquatch is a play of words containing "shock" (for his electrical powers) and [[Wikipedia:Bigfoot|sasquatch]] (another name for Bigfoot, which Shocksquatch bears resemblance to).

==Trivia==
*Shocksquatch speaks with a [[Wikipedia:Canada|Canadian]] accent because sasquatches (famously known as [[Wikipedia:Bigfoot|Bigfoot]]) are believed to be from [[Wikipedia:North America|North America]] in folklore.
**In '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''', electrical and/or monkey sounds are heard whenever Shocksquatch speaks. He also has a habit of ending his sentences with "eh?".
**The Canadian accent is a reference to [[David Kaye]]'s uncle.{{Refn|https://preservetube.com/watch?v&#61;v8jTLJxmMBk|group = DK}}{{Refn|https://www.youtube.com/live/unaX1hKhOy4|group = DK}}
*As of '''Omniverse''', Shocksquatch is the only alien that generates yellow electricity.
**[[Electricyeti]] originally generated yellow electricity<ref name="S23"/> before it was changed to blue.<ref name="ATTWB" />
**In ''[[TKO]]'', he generates purple electricity.
*Shocksquatch is one of four regular aliens to have a complete redesign in '''Omniverse'''; the others being [[Eatle]], [[Swampfire]], and [[Chromastone (Classic)|Chromastone]].
*Shocksquatch is one of four aliens to debut in a special or movie; the others being [[Way Big (Classic)|Way Big]], [[Eon (Transformation)|Eon]], and [[Nanomech]].
*Shocksquatch was created by [[Man of Action]].{{Refn|[[:File:Shocksquatch Made by MoA.png]]|group = DR}}{{Refn|[[:File:Shocksquatch and Shock Rock Were Created By MoA.png]]|group = DR}}{{Refn|group=DR|[[:File:MoA came up with Shocksquatch.png]]|name=creation}}<!--TNP did not design Shocksquatch. See [[:File:Tom Perkins did not draw Shocksquatch.png]]-->
**[[Bandai]] wanted an exclusive character to appear in the ''[[Ben 10-Generator Rex: Heroes United|Heroes United]]'' crossover.{{Refn|[[:File:Bandai wanted Shocksquatch in OV.png]]|group = DR}}{{Refn|https://youtu.be/nmVFTDf_y2w|group = DR}} 
*Shocksquatch's name changed three times during the production of ''[[Ben 10-Generator Rex: Heroes United|Heroes United]]''.{{Refn|https://preservetube.com/watch?v&#61;nhnSZDFsapY|group = STS|name = video}}
**One of these names was Shock Monkey.{{Refn|group = STS|name = video}}
**Electricyeti was another early name that [[Cartoon Network]] executive Brian Jones came up with.{{Refn|[[:File:Electricyeti Early Name for Shocksquatch.png]]|group = DJW}} This later became the name of [[Ben 23]]'s equivalent of Shocksquatch.
*Shocksquatch's '''Omniverse''' design was created by [[Derrick J. Wyatt]].{{Refn|[[:File:Some of the Aliens Designed by Derrick in OV.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Shocksquatch was considered to appear in the [[Ben 10 (2016 TV Series)|Reboot]] but did not make the cut as an electric alien for [[Ben Tennyson (Reboot)|Ben]] because [[Shock Rock]] was created for plot purposes.{{Refn|[[:File:Shock Rock's Purpose.png]]|group = DR}}

